The earlier attempt lacked a post-reboot FPGA load before the AXI overlay. After reset, the FPGA was loaded and verified before applying the same AXI overlay; that attempt succeeded. This correlation points to unconfigured PL access as a likely explanation, but is not proof of an exclusive root cause.
